      "id": "pointer",
      "title": "Pointer and display",
      "text": "Mouse Mover moves your real pointer and keeps the display awake while active. Manual mouse use takes priority immediately; movement resumes after five seconds without mouse activity. Keeping the display awake continues during this pause. Ask to stop, disable the Ability, or quit Dot to end it. Installation and enablement do not start movement.",
